om/world/us/us-man-calls-911-after-killing-wife-4-children-in-kansas-dies-by-suicide/articleshow/133177714.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/us-man-calls-911-after-killing-wife-4-children-in-kansas-dies-by-suicide/articleshow/133177714.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-12T15:17:23+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133177907,imgsize-88605.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Who is Kick streamer Nanatty? Viral clip sparks backlash over alleged racist remarks on livestream]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133177964.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Japanese Kick streamer Nanatty is under fire after a video surfaced online, appearing to show her using a racial slur while interacting with another streamer. Viewers have also pointed out her derogatory remarks about Black individuals. This incident marks another chapter in a series of controversies for Nanatty during her livestreams, yet neither she nor Kick have responded publicly to the allegations at this time.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/who-is-kick-streamer-nanatty-viral-clip-sparks-backlash-over-alleged-racist-remarks-on-livestream/articleshow/133177964.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/who-is-kick-streamer-nanatty-viral-clip-sparks-backlash-over-alleged-racist-remarks-on-livestream/articleshow/133177964.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-12T15:16:06+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Global Sports Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133177997,imgsize-72624.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[US removed 100 outdated dams in 2025, reconnecting more than 4,893 river miles across 30 states]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133157567.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[In 2025, the US removed 100 outdated and unsafe dams across 30 states, reconnecting more than 4,893 miles of rivers, the highest number of upstream river miles restored through dam removal in a single year. The projects reopened fish habitats, improved river connectivity and addressed public safety concerns. Pennsylvania led with 14 removals, followed by Massachusetts with 11 and Vermont with nine.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/the-united-states-removed-100-outdated-dams-in-2025-reconnecting-more-than-4893-river-miles-across-30-states-and-setting-a-single-year-record-for-upstream-habitat/articleshow/133157567.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/the-united-states-removed-100-outdated-dams-in-2025-reconnecting-more-than-4893-river-miles-across-30-states-and-setting-a-single-year-record-for-upstream-habitat/articleshow/133157567.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-12T15:05:37+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133158019,imgsize-233825.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[77-year-old woman pays $69 to cuddle with strangers, but leaves disappointed]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133177334.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/77-year-old-woman-pays-69-to-cuddle-with-strangers-in-new-york-but-nobody-asks-to-touch-her-and-she-leaves-disappointed/articleshow/133177334.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/77-year-old-woman-pays-69-to-cuddle-with-strangers-in-new-york-but-nobody-asks-to-touch-her-and-she-leaves-disappointed/articleshow/133177334.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-12T14:58:12+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133177596,imgsize-819377.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Dry lightning, record-low lake: British Columbia drought puts region on high alert]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133177422.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/dry-lightning-record-low-lake-british-columbia-drought-puts-region-on-high-fire-alert/articleshow/133177422.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/dry-lightning-record-low-lake-british-columbia-drought-puts-region-on-high-fire-alert/articleshow/133177422.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-12T14:52:25+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133177579,imgsize-338193.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[‘Small revolution’: France bans unsolicited telemarketing calls without consent]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133177223.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/small-revolution-france-bans-unsolicited-telemarketing-calls-without-consent/articleshow/133177223.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/small-revolution-france-bans-unsolicited-telemarketing-calls-without-consent/articleshow/133177223.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-12T14:41:23+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133177340,imgsize-60910.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[A 12,900-year-old cave in Türkiye reveals a forgotten world of hunter-gatherers and ancient fires]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133176408.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[The Koskarlı Cave in Türkiye has unveiled a remarkable 12,900-year-old layer showcasing the life of hunter-gatherers. This extraordinary find includes evidence of Epipalaeolithic individuals, featuring items like a hearth, stone tools, and personal ornaments. Importantly, these discoveries hint at cultural links between regions such as Anatolia, the Caucasus, and the Levant, paving the way for deeper insights into prehistoric societies.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/a-12900-year-old-cave-has-opened-a-window-into-a-forgotten-world-of-hunter-gatherers-in-trkiye-revealing-ancient-fires-stone-tools-and-personal-ornaments/articleshow/133176408.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/a-12900-year-old-cave-has-opened-a-window-into-a-forgotten-world-of-hunter-gatherers-in-trkiye-revealing-ancient-fires-stone-tools-and-personal-ornaments/articleshow/133176408.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-12T14:13:42+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133176589,imgsize-2290854.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Before Trump’s Turkey plane swap, how Clinton used decoy to land in Pak 26 years ago]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133175253.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CD